(text "All HOST_REF and ESD grounds on this sheet belong only to this host.\nCase buttons and LEDs remain straight-through on passive adapter. No host power is supplied on the cable.\nLED input envelope: 0..5 V common-mode; OFF differential <=0.2 V; ON >=1.4 V. Qualify actual motherboard.\nLM393 inputs tolerate positive voltage with VCC=0; 100k series limits signal loading. Not a universal F_PANEL map."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid 6341dd59-4b3e-5868-9e97-b0f4fc8a0841))
